# The output of one run. What a cell must produce is pinned in its battery, which is the durable
# record; keeping the measurement as well would put the same claim in two places that can drift.
mutation/results/

# The generated site. Only contracts, implementations, tests, the evidence a run produced and the
# instrument that produces it belong here - and a rendering of the catalogue is none of the five.
site/out/
